          "Text": "A Lyapunov fractal plays a population model at two growth rates, A and B, in the order its Sequence says, and colors each point by whether the result settles (Stable Color) or goes to chaos (Chaos Color). Pick another Sequence, and drag Center A, Center B and Scale."
